OL,3,GNEWSAMayor backs caller's 'bums, not
OL,4,Abags' train plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool City Region Mayor Steve
OL,7,FRotheram has backed a disabled
OL,8,Fpassenger's call to keep bags off train
OL,9,Fseats.
OL,11,FHe was taking listeners' questions on
OL,12,FBBC Radio Merseyside's Hot Seat when
OL,13,FNorma, from Crosby, raised the issue.
OL,15,FNorma, who uses a three-wheeled walking
OL,16,Faid, said she needed to find a seat
OL,17,Fquickly because trains could jerk as
OL,18,Fthey set off.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
