OL,3,GNEWSAMayor backs caller's 'bums, not
OL,4,Abags' train plea
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Bags don't have a ticket or a pass...
OL,7,Fseats are for bums, not bags," she
OL,8,Fsaid, to which Rotheram replied that
OL,9,Fshe was "absolutely right".
